{"id":"zhalko","lemma":"жалко","pos":"adv","rank":1592,"glosses":["pitiably, miserably, wretchedly","negligibly","plaintively"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d6/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это было жалко.","en":"That was pathetic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/670051","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Теперь мне её жалко.","en":"Now I feel sorry for her.","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"her"},null]},{"text":"Мне его очень жалко.","en":"I feel very sorry for him.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Мне жалко этих детей.","en":"I feel sorry for these children.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null,{"g":"child","l":"ребёнок"}]},{"text":"Мне тебя не жалко.","en":"I don't feel sorry for you.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}